  "description": {
    "reference": "61293632",
    "content": "Via Satrico, near Piazza Zama, we are offering three rooms for rent in a 120 m² commercial apartment on the second floor of a building with a lift.\nThere are three rooms: two at €500 per month and one larger room at €520 per month. An additional €140 covers condominium fees, water, TARI (waste tax) and heating; other utilities are charged separately.\nThe apartment’s shared areas include an entrance hall, living room, kitchen, bathroom, storage room and two balconies.\nThe contract is a temporary student rental, and only female students are eligible.",
